   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "EFFECTS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 3, CC 33 to 48\n   1 Wind\n   2 Chaos\n   3 Cloth reacts\n   4 Impacts per beat\n   5 Breaks\n   6 Settle time\n   7 Weight\n   8 Fur length\n   9 Clumping\n  10 Frizz\n  11 Hair color\n  12 Shine\n  13 Fur reacts to\n  14 Fur lag\n  15 Element\n  16 Thickness\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 3, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Growth\n   2 Curl\n   3 Splash\n   4 Scattered things\n   5 Fire lights the scene\n   6 Forces in the air\n   7 Cloth\n   8 Things that crash and break\n   9 Bits in the air\n  10 Hair and fur\n  11 Water and liquids\n  12 Smoke and fire\n  13 suite: Storm\n  14 suite: Hearth\n  15 suite: Brawl\n  16 suite: Slow motion\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 3, CC 65 to 80\n   1 suite: Drenched\n   2 suite: Backlit fluff\n   3 suite: Windblown\n   4 suite: Avalanche\n   5 suite: Drift\n   6 suite: Underwater\n   7 pair: When impacts rise, the shake rises\n   8 pair: When something crashes, the camera shakes\n   9 pair: When something heavy lands, hair and cloth settle a beat later\n  10 pair: When the wind picks up, cloth flies out\n  11 pair: When the wind picks up, hair streams one way\n  12 pair: When it rains, hair goes stringy\n  13 pair: When the water churns, foam builds\n  14 pair: When things break, the mess spreads\n  15 pairs: Weather hits everyone\n  16 pairs: The impact chain\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 3, CC 81 to 81\n   1 pairs: The elements build"
   },
